⚡️🇮🇱🇫🇷 In an attempt to protest against Palestinians being allowed to harvest olives from their own land, Israeli thugs physically attacked Bernard Baudoux (a French mayor), the archbishop of Cambrai (a city in France), and a third diplomat who were visiting the Palestinian town of Taybeh for the olive harvest with a delegation of European diplomats.

They attacked old, unarmed, European diplomats because they do not want Palestinians to harvest olive from their own land.

